SUSPECTED BUG: call-site target in a go statement: go warm(s).
Expected 2 entries: store.ErrNotFound wrapped "get %q: %w"; store.ErrClosed unwrapped with [+1 more paths] (it reaches warm via ping() AND via s.Get->Check), exactly as the declaration target decl_warm_paths prints it. Must NOT contain disk.ErrNoEntry (warm returns nil when errors.Is(err, disk.ErrNoEntry)).
Actual: entries are right, but the ErrClosed entry lacks the [+1 more paths] marker: paths merged inside the callee are not counted for a call-site Target (same with a plain, non-go call).
